  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Let us list some hidden GameObjects on VRC_AvatarDescriptor to mark them for VRChat. The client can be updated to make sure only one is activated at a time. The final performance rank can then be the worst the avatar could be, instead of counting everything.\n\nNo forced changes. Must be set up manually. Intended for creative avatar makers who want to list objects that will never be active together. This is so performance rank isn't unfairly impacted by things that cannot be active together.",
